  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nCurrently, the cloning steps for input elements do not propagate the indeterminateness of the input element.\n\nHowever, all major implementations propagate if the element is indeterminate (see [here](https://wpt.fyi/results/html/semantics/forms/the-input-element/cloning-steps.html?label=master&label=experimental&aligned)).\n\nI would suggest updating the spec in order to propagate the [indeterminate IDL attribute](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/input.html#dom-input-indeterminate) as well.",
